[{"id":"19","date":"2026-10-23T08:01:35+00:00","text":"​ 🚨 YOUR PERSONAL FRIDAY UPGRADE 🚨 ​If you want to skip the massive, noisy lists of global Friday releases, there is a much smarter playlist waiting for you on the app right now. ​ ➡️ RELEASE RADAR 📡 ✨ ​Unlike \"New Music Friday\", this weekly playlist is 100% custom-made for your account. It updates every single Friday to bring you the brand-new singles, collaborations, and album tracks from the specific artists and bands you already follow and love . ​It’s completely automated, effortless, and is the absolute best way to ensure you never miss a new release from your favorite musicians. ​Open Spotify, check your Home or Library, and let your personalized radar set your weekend soundtrack&#33; 🎧 🚀 💚","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"18","date":"2026-10-21T07:45:15+00:00","text":"​ 💡 SPOTIFY HACK: SEARCH BY LYRICS 🔍 ​We have all been there: a song is stuck in your head, but you have absolutely no idea what the title or the artist is. 🧠 🎶 ​You don't need to use Shazam or Google to find it. Spotify has a built-in solution for this exact problem. 🛠️ ​ How it works: Simply open the Spotify search bar and type in the exact lyrics you remember. ✍️ The app will scan its massive database, find the song, and tag it with a \"Lyrics match\" label. 🏷️ ✨ ​A quick and effortless trick to save you from endless frustration. Time to finally find that mystery track&#33; 🎧 💚","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false}]
